						 <div style="text-align: center; color: #600; font-weight: bold;"> <div class="unmargined" style="font-size: 200%; margin: 2px 0 5px;"> <p>欢迎来到SCP基金会人事档案资料库</p> </div> <br /> 警告：以下人事档案属于 <div class="unmargined" style="font-size: 400%; margin: 2px 0 5px;"> <p>高度机密</p> </div> <br /> 严禁未经授权的人员进行访问</div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>关于作者页</span></h2> </div> <p>作者页是用于保存和展示作品列表的地方，因此任何作者页都至少需要你在网站上投稿作品的列表，并提供指向作品的链接。</p> <p>除此之外，在不违反网站站规的前提下，你可以添加任何你想添加的内容。</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>创建作者页的最低标准</span></h2> </div> <p>满足以下条件任意之一即可创建你自己的作者页：</p> <ol> <li>已在网站上发布了至少三篇合格的原创作品； <ul> <li>“合格”指：已发布至少24小时，评分大于等于+10分；</li> <li>“作品”指：SCP条目、GoI格式、故事、指导、文章、艺术作品、被放逐者之图书馆作品。</li> </ul> </li> <li>已在网站上发布了至少五篇翻译作品。</li> </ol> <p>若不满足以上条件（例如作品依照<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/deletions-guide">删帖指导</a>被删除），那么作者页将由职员宣告删除，并在72小时的缓冲期后完全删除。另外，作者页不遵循通常的低分删除标准。</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>提示</span></h2> </div> <p>在建立完你的作者页之后，请依照字母顺序，将你的作者页链接添加到本页合适的位置上，使用如下格式：</p> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">||&#32;[[*user&#32;Wikidot帐号名称]]&#32;||&#32;[[[作者页的链接|标题]]]&#32;||</span></p> </blockquote> <p>你可以使用如下代码来创建简易的作品列表：</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示模版</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏模版</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="code"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">__SCP__：</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;ListPages&#32;created_by=&quot;你的帐号名称&quot;&#32;separate=&quot;no&quot;&#32;limit=&quot;250&quot;&#32;perPage=&quot;250&quot;&#32;tags=&quot;+原创,&#32;+scp,&#32;-搞笑&quot;&#32;order=&quot;title&quot;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">*&#32;%%title_linked%%</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">__搞笑SCP__：</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;ListPages&#32;created_by=&quot;你的帐号名称&quot;&#32;separate=&quot;no&quot;&#32;limit=&quot;250&quot;&#32;perPage=&quot;250&quot;&#32;tags=&quot;+原创,&#32;+scp,&#32;+搞笑&quot;&#32;order=&quot;title&quot;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">*&#32;%%title_linked%%</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">__合著__：</span><br /> 遗憾的是，没有能够使用模块来自动获取合著页面的方法，因此你需要手动来添加列表项目。使用星号（*）来创建列表，以保持格式一致。</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">__GoI格式__：</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;ListPages&#32;created_by=&quot;你的帐号名称&quot;&#32;separate=&quot;no&quot;&#32;limit=&quot;250&quot;&#32;perPage=&quot;250&quot;&#32;tags=&quot;+原创,&#32;+goi格式&quot;&#32;order=&quot;title&quot;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">*&#32;%%title_linked%%</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">__基金会故事__：</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;ListPages&#32;created_by=&quot;你的帐号名称&quot;&#32;separate=&quot;no&quot;&#32;limit=&quot;250&quot;&#32;perPage=&quot;250&quot;&#32;tags=&quot;+原创,&#32;+故事&quot;&#32;order=&quot;title&quot;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">*&#32;%%title_linked%%</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">__其他__：</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;ListPages&#32;created_by=&quot;你的帐号名称&quot;&#32;separate=&quot;no&quot;&#32;limit=&quot;250&quot;&#32;perPage=&quot;250&quot;&#32;tags=&quot;+原创,&#32;-scp,&#32;-goi格式,&#32;-故事,&#32;-作者&quot;&#32;order=&quot;title&quot;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">*&#32;%%title_linked%%</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">__被放逐者之图书馆__：</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;ListPages&#32;created_by=&quot;你的帐号名称&quot;&#32;separate=&quot;no&quot;&#32;limit=&quot;250&quot;&#32;perPage=&quot;250&quot;&#32;category=&quot;wanderers&quot;&#32;tags=&quot;+原创&quot;&#32;order=&quot;title&quot;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">*&#32;%%title_linked%%</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>如果关于作者页还有疑问或需要帮助的话，请联系工作人员。</p> <hr /> <h2><span>管理员</span></h2> <div style="text-align: center;"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/areyoucrazytom" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1476662&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="Areyoucrazytom" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1476662)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/areyoucrazytom" >Areyoucrazytom</a></span></td> <td>[资料删除]</td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1745583&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="MScarlet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745583)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" >MScarlet</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scarlet-s-personnel-file">收容专家Scarlet博士的人事档案</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-sunny-day-at-the-clockwork-gallery">A Sunny Day at the Clockwork Gallery</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/holy-darklight" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1768886&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="Holy_Darklight" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1768886)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/holy-darklight" >Holy_Darklight</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/holy-darklight-s-personnel-file">Holy_Darklight博士的个人档案</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2941964&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="M Element" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2941964)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" >M Element</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/m-element-s-personnel-file">Maple Element的人事档案</a></td> </tr> </table> </div> <hr /> <h2><span>版主</span></h2> <div style="text-align: center;"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flying-jellyfish" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1925789&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="Flying Jellyfish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1925789)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flying-jellyfish" >Flying Jellyfish</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/flying-jellyfish-s-personnel-file">监测到不稳定的现实扭曲现象，特工果冻鱼的人事文档正在迎接大结局（七夕特定事件触发中）</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3317001&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="W Asriel" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3317001)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel" >W Asriel</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/agent-asriel">特工Asriel的人事档案</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4476849&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="Sekai_s" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4476849)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" >Sekai_s</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sekai-s-personnel-file">世界</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3930061&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="DrStse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3930061)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstse" >DrStse</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/stse-wake">Stse博士的人事档案</a></td> </tr> </table> </div> <hr /> <h2><span>其他职员</span></h2> <div style="text-align: center;"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jochoi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4255421&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="Jochoi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4255421)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jochoi" >Jochoi</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/zokhoi">持匙鑿舀以空海</a></td> </tr> </table> </div> <hr /> <h2><span>普通成员</span></h2> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>- 索引 -</strong></p> </div> <div style="text-align: center; width: 100%; font-size:1.25em; font-weight: bold;"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#num">#</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#A">A</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#B">B</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#C">C</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#D">D</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#E">E</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#F">F</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#G">G</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#H">H</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#I">I</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#J">J</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#K">K</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#L">L</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#M">M</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#N">N</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#O">O</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#P">P</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#Q">Q</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#R">R</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#S">S</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#T">T</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#U">U</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#V">V</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#W">W</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#X">X</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#Y">Y</a>|<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/members-pages-cn#Z">Z</a></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><a name="num"></a></p> <h1><span>- # -</span></h1> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3550607&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="#ApmV" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3550607)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv" >#ApmV</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/ploto">God's vibe</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/62ecn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4008607&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="62ECN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4008607)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/62ecn" >62ECN</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/62ecn">Dr. Ecun的陵寝</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/7starsseeker" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2762059&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="7starsseeker" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2762059)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/7starsseeker" >7starsseeker</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dr7s-s-personnel-file">研究员Dr.Seven█████的人事档案</a></td> </tr> </table> <p><a name="A"></a></p> <h1><span>- A -</span></h1> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/abigail-ade" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5984391&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906538" alt="Abigail_Ade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5984391)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/abigail-ade" >Abigail_Ade</a></span></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/a