w.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745066)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ak1-yorunaga" >ak1-yorunaga</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>那个记者一定是被人灭口了……日创做的吗？还是别的什么组织做的？他到底得到了什么风声？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-591-jp">SCP-591-JP</a></td> <td>爆ックソ踏ント</td> <td>踩到了会炸的粪便</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/new-wave" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3688222&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="New_wave" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3688222)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/new-wave" >New_wave</a></span></td> <td>负号部队</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>负号部队的守备范围超乎我想象地广……这种不择手段的存在，何等的可怕啊。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-592-jp">SCP-592-JP</a></td> <td>穀潰し</td> <td>吃闲饭</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ripeya" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1971450&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="ripeya-" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1971450)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ripeya" >ripeya-</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我推测这应该是通过摄食而制造建材的动物，毒性这一点应该是他们的疏漏。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-857-jp">SCP-857-JP</a></td> <td>ヤギは盲目</td> <td>盲目的山羊</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hey-kounoike" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2094799&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="hey_kounoike" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2094799)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hey-kounoike" >hey_kounoike</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>孤独的话死就好了吗，嗯？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-978-jp">SCP-978-JP</a></td> <td>運び屋</td> <td>搬运工</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/k-u-m-a" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1886872&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="k_u_m_a" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1886872)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/k-u-m-a" >k_u_m_a</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>人肉炸弹……说起来日创这是接了什么组织的订单啊，难道是恐怖分子？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1465-jp">SCP-1465-JP</a></td> <td>銭と蟻</td> <td>钱与蚁</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></td> <td>JAGPATO</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>冻雾，又是冻雾……他怕不是把这个当成了他的实验体仓库哟（笑）时间线上这个应该在报告书之前吧。<br /> 这帮贪污的混蛋也够该死的……这不就是把最基本的权利剥夺了吗？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1527-jp">SCP-1527-JP</a></td> <td>委託のフレーバー</td> <td>托付的香料</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hyoroika09" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3406303&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="hyoroika09" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3406303)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hyoroika09" >hyoroika09</a></span></td> <td>Are We Cool Yet?</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我接触到的第一个和AWCY有关的日创项目。<br /> 真是异术家<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-18853-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>也不好当呀！（笑）</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1318-jp">SCP-1318-JP</a></td> <td>マーメイド・アニサキス</td> <td>人鱼异尖线虫</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/amadai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2768562&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="AMADAI" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2768562)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/amadai" >AMADAI</a></span></td> <td>梦见科技</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>梦见科技，我以前没有见过这个GoI……调查进行了快四个月，很多之前没听过的组织都渐渐浮出水面来了，是这样吗……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1333-jp">SCP-1333-JP</a></td> <td>いびき消し薬</td> <td>打鼾消除药</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noyama" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3346860&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="noyama" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3346860)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noyama" >noyama</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我从来没听说过打呼噜还能招来虫子。<br /> 不过，雇这个人作为基金会的特工，也许是个好主意……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1590-jp">SCP-1590-JP</a></td> <td>フェアトレードコーヒー</td> <td>公平贸易咖啡</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这已经是第几个涉及冻雾的项目了？时间线上没有的东西也开始出现了，到底该怎么修改……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1964-jp">SCP-1964-JP</a></td> <td>かえるの歌が聞こえてくるよ</td> <td>听得到青蛙唱歌哦</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karatema" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3345869&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="Karatema" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3345869)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karatema" >Karatema</a></span></td> <td>东弊重工</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>东弊的东西应该没问题，日创的似乎也……不过这两个加一起就不能叫没问题了。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1806-jp">SCP-1806-JP</a></td> <td>勅瀬研究員の受難</td> <td>敕濑研究员的受难</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/atrs-lg" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2788230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="atrs_lg" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2788230)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/atrs-lg" >atrs_lg</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>忽然想到了《庄子》里面写的：“嗟乎！夫造物者又将以予为此拘拘也。”<br /> 当然了这帮家伙可不能叫做造物者。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1919-jp">SCP-1919-JP</a></td> <td>下品なジョーロ</td> <td>低劣的喷壶</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-001" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2577572&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906542" alt="SOYA-001" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2577572)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-001" >SOYA-001</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>好心办坏事还害死了自己的村民，简直没有什么比这种事情更伤一个老人的心了……这群[脏话删除]混蛋难道不是拿他们做实验体了吗？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1979-jp">SCP-1979-JP</a></td> <td>たけのこの山</td> <td>竹笋山</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wagnascousin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3389120&amp;amp;size=small