ntuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2353778&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906543" alt="Letitia213" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2353778)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213" >Letitia213</a></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/13-mr-purple">13. 紫色先生</a></td> <td><span class="printuser deleted" data-id="45294"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/common--images/avatars/default/a16.png" alt="" />(account deleted)</span></td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2353778&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906543" alt="Letitia213" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2353778)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213" >Letitia213</a></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/14-mr-brass">14. 黃銅先生</a></td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grandender" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=498523&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906543" alt="GrandEnder" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=498523)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grandender" >GrandEnder</a></span></td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2353778&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608906543" alt="Letitia213" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2353778)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213" >Letitia213</a></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/15-ms-sweetie">15. 甜